  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kasaali Coffee Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee Production and Export, Beneficiaries: Smallholder farmers (1,898 total - 948 female and 950 male), Summary: The project funds will be used to increase the size of the Association&apos;s revolving loan fund for farmers, purchase a truck for transport, build a warehouse for proper coffee storage, facilitate the acquisition of a Fair Trade Certification, and expand into the export market for coffee.</narrative>
  </description>
